      <data key="d3">Knowing that the policy has a 20-year term allows us to infer that it began on January 15, 2024, since the term spans exactly two decades from inception.</data>
      <data key="d4">DEFINES_DURATION</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
