      <data key="d3">The statement that the policy term is 20 years clarifies the time frame associated with the policy's name, confirming that the "20-Year" descriptor refers precisely to the length of coverage.</data>
      <data key="d4">CONFIRMS</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
