      <data key="d3">Given that the policy has a 20-year term, it naturally concludes on a specific future date calculated from its inception. Fact_sentence_2 confirms the exact expiration date consistent with this term.</data>
      <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.98</data>
    </edge>
