      <data key="d3">The 20-year term establishes the timeframe over which the monthly automatic deductions occur, ensuring consistent premium collection throughout the policy's active period.</data>
      <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b9bffd3e-9339-46c9-88e5-c86723b048a8" target="92e1786a-d888-499c-81ce-89af6f2f700d">
      <data key="d3">The 20-year term defines how long the coverage lasts, while the $45 monthly premium specifies the cost of maintaining that coverage over time. These details describe different aspects of the same policy without direct causal or sequential dependence.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
