      <data key="d3">The 20-year term defines the coverage window, independent of personal relationships like marriage. This factual detail sets time boundaries without referencing any individual’s role.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
