    <edge source="b9bffd3e-9339-46c9-88e5-c86723b048a8" target="178f1ff5-b810-4b49-ac2e-26311d446d64">
      <data key="d3">The 20-year policy term sets the timeframe during which the death benefit becomes applicable. Without this defined term, the death benefit would lack contextual validity or enforceability.</data>
      <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
