    <edge source="b9bffd3e-9339-46c9-88e5-c86723b048a8" target="b573dc79-16fa-4d62-ac47-9944687f176c">
      <data key="d3">The 20-year term sets the overall duration of coverage, while a Policy Anniversary marks the recurring anniversary of the policy’s issuance each year. These concepts coexist temporally but do not influence each other directly.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
