      <data key="d3">The 20-year term defines the window during which the policy remains active, enabling contingencies like the primary beneficiary’s predeceasing the insured, which would activate Lucas’s entitlement to half the death benefit.</data>
      <data key="d4">CONTEXTUAL_DEPENDENCE</data>
