    <edge source="68115e7f-f7b6-423f-93fb-d3d8750f2e29" target="bd80be22-bae6-431a-81b1-2f430fdc473c">
      <data key="d3">The identity of the primary beneficiary, Sarah Elizabeth Anderson, is unrelated to the policy's identifying number.</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="68115e7f-f7b6-423f-93fb-d3d8750f2e29" target="b178757c-5941-42c0-9651-c1536385e35b">
      <data key="d3">The identification of Sarah Elizabeth Anderson as the primary beneficiary determines claim eligibility. This status remains unchanged regardless of the policy’s issue date, which only marks its inception.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="68115e7f-f7b6-423f-93fb-d3d8750f2e29" target="e2e0db09-1411-4193-961b-49f641340784">
      <data key="d3">Sarah Elizabeth Anderson’s status as the primary beneficiary is contingent upon the existence of a specific policy type—namely, the 20-Year Level Term Life Insurance—which governs when and how her claim would be processed.</data>
      <data key="d4">DEFINED_BY</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="68115e7f-f7b6-423f-93fb-d3d8750f2e29" target="c3e2289f-6e9b-4f8f-8308-ced029f5f506">
      <data key="d3">Sarah Elizabeth Anderson is designated as the primary beneficiary, a role that depends on the policy being owned by someone like John Michael Anderson, who has the right to assign such benefits.</data>
      <data key="d4">BENEFICIARY_DESIGNATED_BY_OWNER</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="68115e7f-f7b6-423f-93fb-d3d8750f2e29" target="7f8cb083-f7ed-4837-a460-150e15a7c2d1">
      <data key="d3">Sarah Elizabeth Anderson is designated as the primary recipient of the death benefit, but only in relation to the insured, John Michael Anderson, whose passing triggers her entitlement.</data>
      <data key="d4">RELATED_TO</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="68115e7f-f7b6-423f-93fb-d3d8750f2e29" target="9b6acf89-8e86-43c2-878b-9300e5dc9a2b">
      <data key="d3">The identification of Sarah Elizabeth Anderson as the primary beneficiary does not depend on the insured’s date of birth; it is an independent contractual designation.</data>
      <data key="d4">UNRELATED</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="68115e7f-f7b6-423f-93fb-d3d8750f2e29" target="46205e89-c698-46b2-991f-35e0dd9be668">
      <data key="d3">The identification of Sarah Elizabeth Anderson as the primary beneficiary does not rely on or impact the insured’s age.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="68115e7f-f7b6-423f-93fb-d3d8750f2e29" target="6bf61b64-8ea1-4157-b63e-7ea1c96a8aa9">
      <data key="d3">Sarah Elizabeth Anderson is named as the primary recipient of the $500,000 death benefit under the policy's terms.</data>
      <data key="d4">RECIPIENT_OF</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="68115e7f-f7b6-423f-93fb-d3d8750f2e29" target="70feef39-e3b5-4a93-9e69-79a091efe2e9">
      <data key="d3">Sarah Elizabeth Anderson being designated as the primary beneficiary specifies who receives the death benefit, irrespective of when the policy ends.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="68115e7f-f7b6-423f-93fb-d3d8750f2e29" target="b9bffd3e-9339-46c9-88e5-c86723b048a8">
      <data key="d3">The primary beneficiary, Sarah Elizabeth Anderson, is entitled to receive the death benefit only if the insured dies during the 20-year term; her status is contingent on the policy being active at that time.</data>
      <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.3</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="68115e7f-f7b6-423f-93fb-d3d8750f2e29" target="92e1786a-d888-499c-81ce-89af6f2f700d">
      <data key="d3">Sarah Elizabeth Anderson being named the primary beneficiary determines who receives the death benefit, independent of the $45.00 monthly premium payment requirement.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="68115e7f-f7b6-423f-93fb-d3d8750f2e29" target="c213cb6d-bc43-42c0-9cc8-b53860ab254b">
      <data key="d3">Knowing that Sarah Elizabeth Anderson is the primary beneficiary does not affect or explain the mechanism of monthly automatic premium deductions.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="68115e7f-f7b6-423f-93fb-d3d8750f2e29" target="2cc79eb8-7783-467b-b2ad-cad32efd2a0c">
      <data key="d3">Sarah Elizabeth Anderson is named as the primary beneficiary, but this fact does not provide any information about her relation to Emma, who is identified separately as the daughter of the insured.</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="68115e7f-f7b6-423f-93fb-d3d8750f2e29" target="53ad6f3d-85c7-46d3-8a96-bb170408cdd8">
      <data key="d3">Sarah Elizabeth Anderson is the primary beneficiary entitled to receive the death benefit if she outlives the insured. Emma Grace Anderson serves as a contingent beneficiary, meaning she would inherit only if Sarah predeceases John Michael Anderson.</data>
      <data key="d4">CONTINGENT_ON</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="68115e7f-f7b6-423f-93fb-d3d8750f2e29" target="a04dd995-de44-4f7d-adaa-d6a1e6223a7e">
      <data key="d3">Sarah Elizabeth Anderson is the primary beneficiary, meaning Emma only inherits if Sarah predeceases John. Emma’s 50% share results from being one of two equal contingent beneficiaries named in the policy.</data>
      <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_ON</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="68115e7f-f7b6-423f-93fb-d3d8750f2e29" target="7f9cc4e6-7309-41fc-89b5-a0f2bf367607">
      <data key="d3">Sarah Elizabeth Anderson’s status as primary beneficiary sets up the condition under which Lucas becomes eligible to receive a portion of the death benefit. His 50% share arises because he is one of two equal contingent beneficiaries named in the policy.</data>
      <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="68115e7f-f7b6-423f-93fb-d3d8750f2e29" target="61095de3-b57e-4b5b-ba01-9a506f62acd3">
      <data key="d3">Sarah Elizabeth Anderson is the primary beneficiary entitled to the death benefit if she outlives the insured. Lucas James Anderson is listed as a contingent beneficiary, meaning he would receive an inheritance only if Sarah predeceases the insured.</data>
      <data key="d4">CONTINGENT_ON</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="68115e7f-f7b6-423f-93fb-d3d8750f2e29" target="178f1ff5-b810-4b49-ac2e-26311d446d64">
      <data key="d3">Sarah Elizabeth Anderson is identified as the recipient of the death benefit under the policy, which is defined as the sum paid upon the insured’s death during the term.</data>
      <data key="d4">EXPLAINS</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="68115e7f-f7b6-423f-93fb-d3d8750f2e29" target="b573dc79-16fa-4d62-ac47-9944687f176c">
      <data key="d3">Sarah Elizabeth Anderson being named the primary beneficiary has no bearing on the definition of a Policy Anniversary, which is an annual date tied to the issuance of the policy.</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="68115e7f-f7b6-423f-93fb-d3d8750f2e29" target="086e886c-9134-4e1e-85d7-0fcdb31e485b">
      <data key="d3">Sarah Elizabeth Anderson is listed as the primary beneficiary, and her status as the spouse of the insured helps explain her role in the policy's beneficiary hierarchy.</data>
      <data key="d4">EXPLAINS</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="68115e7f-f7b6-423f-93fb-d3d8750f2e29" target="24f6a5ad-25db-42dc-939d-c4d5b2ed9a0f">
      <data key="d3">Since Sarah Elizabeth Anderson is named the primary beneficiary, she receives the full death benefit of $500,000 upon the insured’s passing, assuming no prior claims or changes.</data>
      <data key="d4">PRIMARY BENEFICIARY</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">1.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="68115e7f-f7b6-423f-93fb-d3d8750f2e29" target="b0753f1c-4ff3-48b1-9b47-e666a0d807ea">
      <data key="d3">Sarah Elizabeth Anderson is named as the primary beneficiary, while Lucas James Anderson is identified as the son of the insured. This establishes that Lucas is part of the family network tied to the policyholder, though he is designated as a contingent beneficiary rather than the primary recipient.</data>
      <data key="d4">RELATED_TO</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.3</data>
    </edge>
