      <data key="d3">The grace period is a feature of the policy's payment terms, and its existence helps contextualize how premiums like those described in the chunk summary are managed—but it does not rely on or explain the policy number assigned to the contract.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
