      <data key="d3">From chunk 2's perspective, chunk 1 serves as a practical example illustrating key components discussed generally—such as premium schedules, beneficiary designations, and grace periods—with real-world specificity regarding names, amounts, and timing.</data>
      <data key="d4">PROVIDES_CONTEXT</data>
