      <data key="d3">The grace period ensures ongoing coverage even if payments are delayed, allowing policyholders time to rectify missed premiums. However, any decision to convert to permanent insurance must still meet the stricter timeline tied to either the policy’s expiry or the insured reaching age 65.</data>
