      <data key="d3">Even if coverage has terminated due to missed payments, the suicide exclusion still applies if the insured dies by suicide within the first two years, though no death benefit would be payable regardless of coverage status at time of death.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
