    <edge source="a00a97b2-e4e5-454c-aabc-bb7861c62db6" target="15f70e44-bcd8-4fe7-aa61-1b7eaf9f1349">
      <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 establishes a time-bound restriction on death benefits related to the issue date, independent of the concept of a policy anniversary defined in fact sentence 1.</data>
