      <data key="d3">The first sentence outlines a limitation on death benefit payments if suicide occurs within two years of policy issuance. The second sentence explains how premiums are determined when converting to permanent insurance, depending on the desired coverage level. These statements concern different policy provisions and do not influence one another directly.</data>
