      <data key="d5">0.45</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="883362bb-b7cf-40c8-9801-eb185d0f0958" target="a00a97b2-e4e5-454c-aabc-bb7861c62db6">
      <data key="d3">There are no further exclusions beyond the suicide clause in the first two years, meaning the limitation described in the prior sentence fully defines the policy's exclusion framework.</data>
      <data key="d4">CONFIRMS</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="883362bb-b7cf-40c8-9801-eb185d0f0958" target="91b85462-1151-4d24-8a71-6adf0d18e83a">
      <data key="d3">The statement that no other exclusions apply sets the boundary conditions for policy limitations but does not influence how premiums are calculated for conversions. The pricing of the converted policy depends solely on the coverage level chosen.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="883362bb-b7cf-40c8-9801-eb185d0f0958" target="65760e57-7d92-40e5-bf11-d6031579bc4b">
      <data key="d3">The statement about no other exclusions implies that standard policy conditions govern conversions, allowing the insurer to base new premiums solely on the insured's attained age at time of conversion.</data>
      <data key="d4">IMPLIES_CONDITIONS</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="883362bb-b7cf-40c8-9801-eb185d0f0958" target="717aac5d-150f-48ca-8d8c-4a8f6ad91954">
      <data key="d3">The statement about no other exclusions reinforces the scope of the policy's provisions, ensuring that the conversion right described in the second sentence is fully applicable without hidden restrictions.</data>
      <data key="d4">SUPPORTS</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="883362bb-b7cf-40c8-9801-eb185d0f0958" target="86082134-46ed-4548-a27f-2a5fed9c25ac">
      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 confirms the absence of further exclusions, providing context about policy limitations. Fact_sentence_2 explains that the premium for a converted permanent policy varies by the selected policy class, reflecting underwriting and risk categorization.</data>
      <data key="d4">NO RELATIONSHIP</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="284998d7-5a28-4d62-b70a-2a1cd03760d8" target="883362bb-b7cf-40c8-9801-eb185d0f0958">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">not subject to exclusion</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="47c9cc26-bff8-460a-985e-6b0e42fd25e3" target="883362bb-b7cf-40c8-9801-eb185d0f0958">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">not subject to exclusion</data>
    </edge>
