    </edge>
    <edge source="86082134-46ed-4548-a27f-2a5fed9c25ac" target="15f70e44-bcd8-4fe7-aa61-1b7eaf9f1349">
      <data key="d3">The determination of premiums based on the selected permanent policy class has no bearing on the occurrence or significance of a 'Policy Anniversary'.</data>
      <data key="d4">NONE</data>
