      <data key="d3">Premiums for a converted permanent policy are calculated based on the selected policy class, but such conversion is only possible before the policy lapses due to unpaid premiums beyond the grace period.</data>
      <data key="d4">PREVENTS_CONVERSION</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.45</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="86082134-46ed-4548-a27f-2a5fed9c25ac" target="cd33eeaf-204c-4c25-b6c4-d8f541f0238a">
      <data key="d3">The second sentence outlines how premiums for converting to permanent insurance are calculated based on the policy class. This has no bearing on whether the death benefit is paid upon the insured's passing, which is addressed in the first sentence.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
