      <data key="d3">Chunk 1 establishes the prerequisites—such as grace periods, conversion options, and exclusions—that determine whether the procedures described in chunk 2 (like claim submission) become applicable.</data>
      <data key="d4">PROVIDES_CONTEXT</data>
