    <edge source="f99df0d3-695f-4ae7-a1f8-eaf509b3c369" target="52ad74d3-5275-4b1c-9bcf-18120fb60997">
      <data key="d3">The conversion amount determines the scope of the new policy’s coverage, independent of any prior inaccuracies in reported age. This factor does not influence how the insurer handles misstatements regarding the insured’s age.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
