      <data key="d3">The first sentence concerns the impact of converted coverage amounts on policy conversion results. The second explains that the corrected death benefit depends on the insured's age when inaccurate information was reported, independent of conversion decisions.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
