      <data key="d3">The first sentence concerns the impact of coverage amount during policy conversion, whereas the second explains how benefits are adjusted if the insured's sex was incorrectly reported. They pertain to separate administrative processes within the same policy framework.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
