      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 discusses how the amount of coverage chosen during conversion alters the final policy result, while fact_sentence_1 sets forth the condition—proof of death—for accessing death benefits. Though related to policy features, these facts operate independently across distinct processes.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
