      <data key="d3">While the amount of converted coverage determines the new policy's features, it has no bearing on whether a death benefit would have been paid had the insured died before expiry. These factors pertain to distinct phases of the policy lifecycle.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT_OF</data>
