      <data key="d3">Submitting a claim form is necessary to receive the death benefit, regardless of how much coverage was converted under the policy terms.</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="cb928733-e199-4fdb-837b-0be5aae920be">
      <data key="d3">Submitting a claim form is necessary to receive the death benefit, regardless of the initial policy class chosen during conversion.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="6a8c51d1-93b9-4569-86fd-03b5a2ff4a43">
      <data key="d3">The second sentence describes a required step in filing a death benefit claim, namely submitting a completed form. This action is independent of whether the insured met age-based conversion criteria earlier in the policy term.</data>
      <data key="d4">NONE</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="ecc65c44-a48a-4f2a-aa01-37fdd58978fd">
      <data key="d3">Submitting a completed claim form is a prerequisite step that initiates the claims process, enabling the insurer to begin processing the request before additional documentation like a certified death certificate is reviewed.</data>
      <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="4f67aca9-2ed1-4582-9192-9aa38dccf3e4">
      <data key="d3">The requirement to submit a completed claim form supports the overall claims process, enabling the insurer to initiate review; this step directly enables the subsequent submission of supporting documents like the original policy.</data>
      <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTS</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="1f53ae68-2eb4-4755-b66c-aa693a6029cb">
      <data key="d3">Submitting a completed claim form is necessary to initiate a death benefit claim, and such submissions must be directed to the specified postal address to ensure proper processing.</data>
      <data key="d4">DIRECTS_TO</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="e102366f-ab52-4878-8cf7-8763f33b2392">
      <data key="d3">The beneficiary must complete a claim form as part of the claims process; this form should be directed to the Claims Department of SecureLife Insurance Company.</data>
      <data key="d4">SENT_TO</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="48cefe40-498d-4ea8-8c59-1a68bc65d395">
      <data key="d3">The submission of a claim form initiates the claims process but does not affect the incontestability clause that protects against future challenges after two years.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="f60bbb6f-361a-478e-b45e-8d28c60a0370">
      <data key="d3">The submission of a completed claim form by the beneficiary triggers the start of the processing timeline, leading to the insurer’s commitment to issue payment within 30 days upon full documentation receipt.</data>
      <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="ef3425a0-1e50-49ab-b5a8-ef77f6ab44bc">
      <data key="d3">The completion of a claim form initiates the claims process, upon which the insurer evaluates any discrepancies such as misstated sex that may affect the final benefit amount.</data>
      <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="7d8ac6d1-e47e-4ba7-b0a0-e181d124cf19">
      <data key="d3">Submitting a claim form initiates the claims process but does not affect how the death benefit is recalculated based on misstated age. The correction depends solely on actuarial rules tied to the insured’s actual age at misstatement.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="6946e734-a717-40f6-a7c6-8217055992b2">
      <data key="d3">Submitting a claim form initiates the death benefit process but does not affect how the benefit is recalculated due to a prior misstatement of sex. This step occurs independently of the misstatement correction mechanism.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="173ed3d5-0eb1-4ff3-a7bb-5ccb01ff26f9">
      <data key="d3">Submitting a claim form initiates the process for receiving the death benefit but does not affect the validity of a policy assignment. The requirement for a completed claim form stands independently from whether an assignment has been communicated to the insurer.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="89eb9f0b-fb9d-4ed0-96df-faae58d5ebda">
      <data key="d3">Submitting a completed claim form is necessary for processing a death benefit payout, and the form's authenticity depends on being properly signed by an authorized official like the Chief Underwriting Officer.</data>
      <data key="d4">VALIDATES</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="93c2148f-1bce-4ce3-bc8c-ba54d157bd99">
      <data key="d3">The beneficiary must complete a claim form as part of the claims process, which must then be submitted to SecureLife Insurance Company.</data>
      <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="1dc42f01-adb8-4c75-b203-736d121f74ba">
      <data key="d3">Submitting a completed claim form is a required step in accessing the death benefit under the policy. This action is independent of when the document itself was issued.</data>
      <data key="d4">NONE</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="58227a0c-85bd-4ca0-9fe2-c849ab8cd359">
      <data key="d3">The requirement to submit a completed claim form relates to initiating the death benefit payout process. This step stands separately from issues concerning the validity of policy assignments, which fall under general provisions about ownership transfers.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="52ad74d3-5275-4b1c-9bcf-18120fb60997">
      <data key="d3">The submission of a claim form initiates the process during which the insurer evaluates potential adjustments to the death benefit if inaccuracies like misstated age are discovered.</data>
      <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="9bd83bcc-7ea7-4a63-aaa4-02253aecdc97">
      <data key="d3">Submitting a claim form is part of the process after the insured's death, while assigning the policy occurs during the policyholder’s lifetime. These actions serve different purposes—claims involve payout distribution, whereas assignments pertain to transferring ownership rights.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="b9bffd3e-9339-46c9-88e5-c86723b048a8">
      <data key="d3">The need to submit a claim form is contingent on the existence of active coverage, such as the 20-year term described in the first fact, ensuring timely processing before expiration.</data>
      <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_ON</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="b178757c-5941-42c0-9651-c1536385e35b">
      <data key="d3">The requirement to submit a completed claim form applies to policies like the one issued on January 15, 2024, ensuring proper verification and processing under standard claims protocols.</data>
      <data key="d4">PROCEDURAL_RELEVANCE</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="70feef39-e3b5-4a93-9e69-79a091efe2e9">
      <data key="d3">The need to submit a claim form is contingent upon the policy being active at the time of death, making its timely submission dependent on the policy’s expiration date.</data>
      <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_ON</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="6bf61b64-8ea1-4157-b63e-7ea1c96a8aa9">
      <data key="d3">Submitting a completed claim form, as stated in fact_sentence_2, is necessary to trigger the disbursement of the $500,000 death benefit mentioned in fact_sentence_1.</data>
      <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="65530dff-13a5-4bc9-975b-c4c8ec2db1db">
      <data key="d3">Submitting a claim form is necessary to receive the death benefit, but only if the policy has remained active; regular premium payments on the 15th help maintain that activity.</data>
      <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="101a86f6-cba5-43af-ae57-a5d5f17d8c1d">
      <data key="d3">Submitting a claim form promptly after the insured’s death enables the beneficiary to access the death benefit while the policy remains active under the grace period provision.</data>
      <data key="d4">ENABLES_CLAIM</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="eb9fe3d3-02a1-4147-9390-55d2407e6851" target="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">is required to claim</data>
    </edge>
