      <data key="d3">Submitting the original policy is necessary for processing a death benefit claim, regardless of whether the insured had converted the policy earlier.</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="4f67aca9-2ed1-4582-9192-9aa38dccf3e4" target="f99df0d3-695f-4ae7-a1f8-eaf509b3c369">
      <data key="d3">Submitting the original policy is required to file a death benefit claim, regardless of the coverage amount used in any prior conversion process.</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="4f67aca9-2ed1-4582-9192-9aa38dccf3e4" target="cb928733-e199-4fdb-837b-0be5aae920be">
      <data key="d3">Submitting the original policy document is necessary to initiate a death benefit claim, regardless of the permanent policy class that may have been selected during conversion.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="4f67aca9-2ed1-4582-9192-9aa38dccf3e4" target="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b">
      <data key="d3">Submitting the original policy document strengthens the validity of the claim and provides essential proof of coverage; it complements the claim form by verifying policy authenticity and terms.</data>
      <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTS</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="4f67aca9-2ed1-4582-9192-9aa38dccf3e4" target="ecc65c44-a48a-4f2a-aa01-37fdd58978fd">
      <data key="d3">Providing the original policy document confirms the validity and terms of the insurance contract; without it, even a properly submitted death certificate cannot lead to payout unless alternative proof is accepted.</data>
      <data key="d4">NECESSARY_FOR</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
