      <data key="d3">Sending the claim to the specified postal box follows after preparing the required documents, including the certified death certificate, ensuring proper delivery once paperwork is finalized.</data>
      <data key="d4">FOLLOWS</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
