      <data key="d3">The second sentence identifies the physical mailing destination for claims: P.O. Box 5000, Hartford, CT 06102. This detail fulfills the requirement stated in the first sentence, which directs claims to the Claims Department of SecureLife Insurance Company.</data>
      <data key="d4">SPECIFIES</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
