      <data key="d3">Claim submissions require sending documents to a specific address; however, this location has no bearing on how the death benefit is recalculated if the insured's age was misrepresented during application.</data>
      <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="1f53ae68-2eb4-4755-b66c-aa693a6029cb" target="52ad74d3-5275-4b1c-9bcf-18120fb60997">
      <data key="d3">The claim submission address is specified separately from the rules governing benefit adjustments due to misstated age. This information supports administrative process clarity without influencing the actuarial correction mechanism.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
