    <edge source="48cefe40-498d-4ea8-8c59-1a68bc65d395" target="6a8c51d1-93b9-4569-86fd-03b5a2ff4a43">
      <data key="d3">After two years from issuance, the insurer loses the right to contest the policy regardless of the insured’s attained age at conversion.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="48cefe40-498d-4ea8-8c59-1a68bc65d395" target="f99df0d3-695f-4ae7-a1f8-eaf509b3c369">
      <data key="d3">After two years from issuance, the policy becomes non-contestable, ensuring its validity regardless of prior inaccuracies; however, this does not alter how the converted coverage amount is determined.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="48cefe40-498d-4ea8-8c59-1a68bc65d395" target="cb928733-e199-4fdb-837b-0be5aae920be">
      <data key="d3">The two-year incontestability rule ensures that SecureLife cannot challenge the policy’s validity after issuance, independent of the specific permanent policy class chosen for conversion.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="48cefe40-498d-4ea8-8c59-1a68bc65d395" target="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b">
      <data key="d3">After two years have passed since issuance, the insurer loses the right to contest the policy, making any subsequent claim more secure regardless of prior information accuracy.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="48cefe40-498d-4ea8-8c59-1a68bc65d395" target="ecc65c44-a48a-4f2a-aa01-37fdd58978fd">
      <data key="d3">The non-contestability clause protects beneficiaries' rights to receive the death benefit upon submission of proper documentation like a certified death certificate, ensuring claims cannot be denied after two years.</data>
      <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="48cefe40-498d-4ea8-8c59-1a68bc65d395" target="4f67aca9-2ed1-4582-9192-9aa38dccf3e4">
      <data key="d3">The two-year incontestability period protects beneficiaries' rights to claim the death benefit, making the submission of required documents like the original policy essential for timely processing.</data>
      <data key="d4">ENFORCES</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="48cefe40-498d-4ea8-8c59-1a68bc65d395" target="93c2148f-1bce-4ce3-bc8c-ba54d157bd99">
      <data key="d3">The two-year incontestability rule prevents SecureLife Insurance Company from challenging the policy after issuance, but this does not influence where claims must be filed—the location of submission remains separate from the timing-based legal restriction.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="48cefe40-498d-4ea8-8c59-1a68bc65d395" target="e102366f-ab52-4878-8cf7-8763f33b2392">
      <data key="d3">The non-contestability clause prevents challenges to the policy’s validity after two years, ensuring that submitting claims to the designated department leads to enforceable benefit payments without dispute.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.15</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="48cefe40-498d-4ea8-8c59-1a68bc65d395" target="1f53ae68-2eb4-4755-b66c-aa693a6029cb">
      <data key="d3">The incontestability provision becomes active after two years from issuance, regardless of when claims are submitted, meaning its applicability is independent of claim submission location.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="48cefe40-498d-4ea8-8c59-1a68bc65d395" target="f60bbb6f-361a-478e-b45e-8d28c60a0370">
      <data key="d3">The incontestability provision prevents the company from challenging the policy after two years, but this does not affect the 30-day timeframe for paying claims once documentation is received.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="48cefe40-498d-4ea8-8c59-1a68bc65d395" target="52ad74d3-5275-4b1c-9bcf-18120fb60997">
      <data key="d3">The two-year incontestability period protects against challenges to the policy’s validity, allowing the insurer to enforce accurate information like misstated age when calculating adjusted benefits.</data>
      <data key="d4">UNDERLIES</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="48cefe40-498d-4ea8-8c59-1a68bc65d395" target="ef3425a0-1e50-49ab-b5a8-ef77f6ab44bc">
      <data key="d3">The two-year incontestability clause ensures that once the policy has been active for two years, the insurer cannot dispute its terms, including those related to misstatements like gender. This allows for fair application of benefit adjustments when such errors are discovered later.</data>
      <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="48cefe40-498d-4ea8-8c59-1a68bc65d395" target="7d8ac6d1-e47e-4ba7-b0a0-e181d124cf19">
      <data key="d3">The incontestability clause ensures that after two years, the insurer cannot dispute the policy terms, including those involving misstatements. This creates the condition under which the misstatement provision applies, allowing for benefit recalculations based on accurate information.</data>
      <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_DEPENDENCY</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="48cefe40-498d-4ea8-8c59-1a68bc65d395" target="6946e734-a717-40f6-a7c6-8217055992b2">
      <data key="d3">The incontestability period ensures the insurer cannot challenge the policy after two years, but does not affect how benefits are recalculated upon discovery of a prior misstatement regarding sex.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="48cefe40-498d-4ea8-8c59-1a68bc65d395" target="173ed3d5-0eb1-4ff3-a7bb-5ccb01ff26f9">
      <data key="d3">The incontestability provision protects the policyholder against future challenges by the insurer after two years but does not affect how ownership changes are processed through assignment.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="48cefe40-498d-4ea8-8c59-1a68bc65d395" target="89eb9f0b-fb9d-4ed0-96df-faae58d5ebda">
      <data key="d3">The incontestability provision ensures that SecureLife cannot dispute the policy after two years, but this does not affect who is authorized to sign documents related to the policy.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="48cefe40-498d-4ea8-8c59-1a68bc65d395" target="58227a0c-85bd-4ca0-9fe2-c849ab8cd359">
      <data key="d3">The incontestability provision protects against future challenges to the policy's validity after two years but does not extend to verifying the legality of assigned interests.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="48cefe40-498d-4ea8-8c59-1a68bc65d395" target="1dc42f01-adb8-4c75-b203-736d121f74ba">
      <data key="d3">The incontestability provision applies only after two years have passed since the policy’s issue date, making the start date essential context for its activation.</data>
      <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="48cefe40-498d-4ea8-8c59-1a68bc65d395" target="9bd83bcc-7ea7-4a63-aaa4-02253aecdc97">
      <data key="d3">The incontestability clause protects the policy from being challenged by the insurer after two years, ensuring stability in coverage. This does not affect the policyholder’s ability to assign the policy, which is governed separately under general provisions.</data>
      <data key="d4">NO_DEPENDENCE</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
