    <edge source="52ad74d3-5275-4b1c-9bcf-18120fb60997" target="6a8c51d1-93b9-4569-86fd-03b5a2ff4a43">
      <data key="d3">An incorrect age statement impacts the final death benefit, meaning the actual attained age used in conversion may differ from the initially stated one, affecting overall policy valuation.</data>
      <data key="d4">CAUSED_BY</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="52ad74d3-5275-4b1c-9bcf-18120fb60997" target="f99df0d3-695f-4ae7-a1f8-eaf509b3c369">
      <data key="d3">When the insured’s age was misrepresented, the insurer recalculates the death benefit based on accurate age-related premium equivalency, regardless of the specific coverage amount selected during conversion.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="52ad74d3-5275-4b1c-9bcf-18120fb60997" target="cb928733-e199-4fdb-837b-0be5aae920be">
      <data key="d3">When the insured's age is incorrectly stated, the insurer recalculates the death benefit based on accurate premium contributions, regardless of the policy class used. This correction operates separately from the conversion rules tied to policy classification.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENTLY_AFFECTS</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.45</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="52ad74d3-5275-4b1c-9bcf-18120fb60997" target="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b">
      <data key="d3">An adjustment to the death benefit due to misstated age only occurs after the claim has been formally submitted via a completed claim form.</data>
      <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="52ad74d3-5275-4b1c-9bcf-18120fb60997" target="ecc65c44-a48a-4f2a-aa01-37fdd58978fd">
      <data key="d3">Adjustments to the death benefit based on misstated age occur during the claims evaluation phase, which begins once required documents like the death certificate are submitted.</data>
      <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="52ad74d3-5275-4b1c-9bcf-18120fb60997" target="4f67aca9-2ed1-4582-9192-9aa38dccf3e4">
      <data key="d3">Adjustments to the death benefit resulting from misstated age may affect the validity or completeness of the claim package that includes the original policy.</data>
      <data key="d4">INFLUENCES</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.45</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="52ad74d3-5275-4b1c-9bcf-18120fb60997" target="93c2148f-1bce-4ce3-bc8c-ba54d157bd99">
      <data key="d3">Adjustments to the death benefit when age is misstated depend on the insurer, SecureLife Insurance Company, receiving the proper claim documents via the designated submission process.</data>
      <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="52ad74d3-5275-4b1c-9bcf-18120fb60997" target="e102366f-ab52-4878-8cf7-8763f33b2392">
      <data key="d3">When the insured’s age is found to be misrepresented, the insurer recalculates the death benefit accordingly. This adjustment occurs after the claim is submitted, regardless of submission method.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="52ad74d3-5275-4b1c-9bcf-18120fb60997" target="1f53ae68-2eb4-4755-b66c-aa693a6029cb">
      <data key="d3">Adjustment of the death benefit for incorrect age does not affect where claims must be mailed. The location for filing remains independent of benefit recalculations.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="52ad74d3-5275-4b1c-9bcf-18120fb60997" target="f60bbb6f-361a-478e-b45e-8d28c60a0370">
      <data key="d3">Adjustments to the death benefit for misstated age are made prior to payment, ensuring that the amount paid aligns with proper actuarial calculations, without delaying the standard 30-day response window.</data>
      <data key="d4">INFLUENCES_PAYMENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
