      <data key="d3">The second sentence explains how incorrect sex reporting leads to adjustments in the death benefit, independent of the conversion process governed by attained age. There is no influence from one mechanism onto the other.</data>
      <data key="d4">NONE</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="6946e734-a717-40f6-a7c6-8217055992b2" target="f99df0d3-695f-4ae7-a1f8-eaf509b3c369">
      <data key="d3">The second sentence explains that the corrected death benefit depends on the insured's sex at the time of misstatement. This rule operates independently of the coverage amount used in conversion decisions.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="6946e734-a717-40f6-a7c6-8217055992b2" target="cb928733-e199-4fdb-837b-0be5aae920be">
      <data key="d3">The determination of corrected benefits due to misstated sex is independent of the specific permanent policy class used during conversion.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="6946e734-a717-40f6-a7c6-8217055992b2" target="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b">
      <data key="d3">The corrected death benefit resulting from a misstated sex applies regardless of whether the claim form has been submitted. The form submission is part of the administrative process that follows any benefit adjustments.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="6946e734-a717-40f6-a7c6-8217055992b2" target="ecc65c44-a48a-4f2a-aa01-37fdd58978fd">
      <data key="d3">If the insured's sex was misstated, the death benefit is recalculated accordingly, regardless of when the certification is submitted, so long as the claim is filed properly.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT_OF</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.45</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="6946e734-a717-40f6-a7c6-8217055992b2" target="4f67aca9-2ed1-4582-9192-9aa38dccf3e4">
      <data key="d3">The corrected death benefit is determined by the insured’s sex during misstatement, regardless of whether the original policy has been submitted. This determination occurs after the initial claim steps.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.15</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="6946e734-a717-40f6-a7c6-8217055992b2" target="93c2148f-1bce-4ce3-bc8c-ba54d157bd99">
      <data key="d3">The correction of the death benefit based on the insured’s actual sex at the time of misstatement does not affect where claims must be submitted; that remains governed by administrative procedures.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="6946e734-a717-40f6-a7c6-8217055992b2" target="e102366f-ab52-4878-8cf7-8763f33b2392">
      <data key="d3">While the correct death benefit is determined by the insured’s sex during misstatement, this does not affect the requirement to send claims to the Claims Department of SecureLife Insurance Company.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="6946e734-a717-40f6-a7c6-8217055992b2" target="1f53ae68-2eb4-4755-b66c-aa693a6029cb">
      <data key="d3">The correction of the death benefit due to misstated sex is independent of the mailing address used for submitting claim documents.</data>
      <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="6946e734-a717-40f6-a7c6-8217055992b2" target="f60bbb6f-361a-478e-b45e-8d28c60a0370">
      <data key="d3">If the insured’s sex was incorrectly stated, the corrected death benefit depends on that accurate information, but payment still occurs within 30 days once proper documents are received.</data>
      <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="6946e734-a717-40f6-a7c6-8217055992b2" target="48cefe40-498d-4ea8-8c59-1a68bc65d395">
      <data key="d3">If the insured misrepresented their sex, the corrected death benefit depends on the actual sex at the time of misstatement; however, this correction only applies once the policy becomes incontestable after two years.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="6946e734-a717-40f6-a7c6-8217055992b2" target="52ad74d3-5275-4b1c-9bcf-18120fb60997">
      <data key="d3">The insured’s sex at the time of misstatement directly influences the final death benefit after adjustments due to incorrect age reporting.</data>
      <data key="d4">CAUSES</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="6946e734-a717-40f6-a7c6-8217055992b2" target="ef3425a0-1e50-49ab-b5a8-ef77f6ab44bc">
      <data key="d3">The insured’s sex at the time of misstatement directly governs the adjusted death benefit, ensuring accuracy in compensation relative to premium payments made.</data>
      <data key="d4">INFORMS</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="6946e734-a717-40f6-a7c6-8217055992b2" target="9bd83bcc-7ea7-4a63-aaa4-02253aecdc97">
      <data key="d3">The correction of the death benefit due to misstated sex applies during claims processing but does not influence the ability to assign the policy. This factual statement stands independently from any administrative or transfer-related provisions.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="6946e734-a717-40f6-a7c6-8217055992b2" target="173ed3d5-0eb1-4ff3-a7bb-5ccb01ff26f9">
      <data key="d3">The first sentence explains how gender misstatements affect death benefit calculations during claims processing. This does not influence or relate to the process required for transferring policy ownership via assignment.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="6946e734-a717-40f6-a7c6-8217055992b2" target="7d8ac6d1-e47e-4ba7-b0a0-e181d124cf19">
      <data key="d3">The corrected death benefit is influenced by the insured's sex at the time of misstatement, just as it is affected by their age during the same period. These two factors operate concurrently in determining the final payout.</data>
      <data key="d4">EQUALLY_RELEVANT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="6946e734-a717-40f6-a7c6-8217055992b2" target="58227a0c-85bd-4ca0-9fe2-c849ab8cd359">
      <data key="d3">The first sentence explains how gender misstatements affect benefit calculations, but it does not relate to the validity of policy assignments discussed in the second sentence.</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="6946e734-a717-40f6-a7c6-8217055992b2" target="89eb9f0b-fb9d-4ed0-96df-faae58d5ebda">
      <data key="d3">The first sentence explains how gender misstatements affect death benefit adjustments, but it does not relate to who signs official documents. This information stands independently from the identity of the signatory.</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="6946e734-a717-40f6-a7c6-8217055992b2" target="1dc42f01-adb8-4c75-b203-736d121f74ba">
      <data key="d3">The first sentence explains how the death benefit is adjusted if the insured's sex was incorrectly stated during application. This explanation stands independently from the second sentence, which only notes the issue date of the document containing such rules.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
