    <edge source="9bd83bcc-7ea7-4a63-aaa4-02253aecdc97" target="6a8c51d1-93b9-4569-86fd-03b5a2ff4a43">
      <data key="d3">While the policyholder may assign the policy, this right is independent of the age-based criteria used during conversion decisions.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="9bd83bcc-7ea7-4a63-aaa4-02253aecdc97" target="f99df0d3-695f-4ae7-a1f8-eaf509b3c369">
      <data key="d3">The right to assign the policy does not affect the outcome of converting coverage; conversion depends solely on attaining eligible age and policy class criteria.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="9bd83bcc-7ea7-4a63-aaa4-02253aecdc97" target="cb928733-e199-4fdb-837b-0be5aae920be">
      <data key="d3">The policyholder’s ability to assign the policy does not influence the conversion outcome tied to the policy class; these are separate contractual features.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="9bd83bcc-7ea7-4a63-aaa4-02253aecdc97" target="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b">
      <data key="d3">The ability to assign a policy allows the policyholder to designate another party as owner before death, but it does not affect the required steps for claiming the death benefit, such as submitting a claim form.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="9bd83bcc-7ea7-4a63-aaa4-02253aecdc97" target="ecc65c44-a48a-4f2a-aa01-37fdd58978fd">
      <data key="d3">A policyholder’s ability to assign the policy allows for transferring ownership prior to death, which could affect who submits the required documents like the death certificate during the claims process.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="9bd83bcc-7ea7-4a63-aaa4-02253aecdc97" target="4f67aca9-2ed1-4582-9192-9aa38dccf3e4">
      <data key="d3">The ability to assign the policy allows ownership transfer before death, potentially influencing who becomes eligible to submit the original policy for a claim.</data>
      <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.3</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="9bd83bcc-7ea7-4a63-aaa4-02253aecdc97" target="93c2148f-1bce-4ce3-bc8c-ba54d157bd99">
      <data key="d3">The ability to assign the policy has no bearing on where claims must be sent; assignment concerns ownership rights, whereas claim submission involves filing procedures after death.</data>
      <data key="d4">NONE</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="9bd83bcc-7ea7-4a63-aaa4-02253aecdc97" target="e102366f-ab52-4878-8cf7-8763f33b2392">
      <data key="d3">The option to assign the policy does not affect the process of submitting a claim; it is unrelated to where claims must be filed.</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="9bd83bcc-7ea7-4a63-aaa4-02253aecdc97" target="1f53ae68-2eb4-4755-b66c-aa693a6029cb">
      <data key="d3">The ability to assign the policy does not affect where claims must be submitted; they are independent administrative processes.</data>
      <data key="d4">NONE</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="9bd83bcc-7ea7-4a63-aaa4-02253aecdc97" target="f60bbb6f-361a-478e-b45e-8d28c60a0370">
      <data key="d3">The option to assign the policy does not influence how quickly claims are paid after submission of documents.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="9bd83bcc-7ea7-4a63-aaa4-02253aecdc97" target="52ad74d3-5275-4b1c-9bcf-18120fb60997">
      <data key="d3">The second statement indicates that the policyholder has the right to assign the policy. This right exists independently of any potential adjustments to the death benefit due to misstated age.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="9bd83bcc-7ea7-4a63-aaa4-02253aecdc97" target="ef3425a0-1e50-49ab-b5a8-ef77f6ab44bc">
      <data key="d3">The second statement confirms that the policyholder retains the right to assign the policy, which allows transferring ownership. This provision operates independently of any adjustments made due to misstated demographic information like sex.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="9bd83bcc-7ea7-4a63-aaa4-02253aecdc97" target="48cefe40-498d-4ea8-8c59-1a68bc65d395">
      <data key="d3">The right to assign the policy allows the holder to transfer ownership, independent of the incontestability period. This means even if the insurer could have contested earlier, such challenges cease after two years regardless of any assignment.</data>
      <data key="d4">NO_DEPENDENCE</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="9bd83bcc-7ea7-4a63-aaa4-02253aecdc97" target="6946e734-a717-40f6-a7c6-8217055992b2">
      <data key="d3">The option to assign the policy reflects ownership flexibility but does not affect how benefits are recalculated when sex was inaccurately reported at issuance. Assignment rights exist regardless of misstatement corrections.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="9bd83bcc-7ea7-4a63-aaa4-02253aecdc97" target="7d8ac6d1-e47e-4ba7-b0a0-e181d124cf19">
      <data key="d3">The second sentence notes that the policyholder may assign the policy, but this does not influence or relate to how the death benefit is determined when age was misrepresented. Assignment rights operate independently of benefit correction rules.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="9bd83bcc-7ea7-4a63-aaa4-02253aecdc97" target="58227a0c-85bd-4ca0-9fe2-c849ab8cd359">
      <data key="d3">The ability to assign the policy creates a scenario where the insurer explicitly avoids liability regarding the assignment's validity.</data>
      <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="9bd83bcc-7ea7-4a63-aaa4-02253aecdc97" target="1dc42f01-adb8-4c75-b203-736d121f74ba">
      <data key="d3">The right to assign the policy exists regardless of when it was issued. The issuance date provides contextual timing but does not affect the validity of such an assignment.</data>
      <data key="d4">NONE</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="9bd83bcc-7ea7-4a63-aaa4-02253aecdc97" target="89eb9f0b-fb9d-4ed0-96df-faae58d5ebda">
      <data key="d3">The right to assign the policy relies on proper authorization, which is confirmed by the designated official's signature on relevant documents.</data>
      <data key="d4">VALIDATES</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="9bd83bcc-7ea7-4a63-aaa4-02253aecdc97" target="173ed3d5-0eb1-4ff3-a7bb-5ccb01ff26f9">
      <data key="d3">The ability to assign the policy depends on SecureLife Insurance Company's acknowledgment through written notice. Without this step, the assignment remains ineffective despite being initiated.</data>
      <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0deb2007-882b-4fc4-a126-84bce648ee00" target="9bd83bcc-7ea7-4a63-aaa4-02253aecdc97">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">temporal_constraint_on_assignment</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="1c3767ec-f1de-4241-9998-d5c1d88b582c" target="9bd83bcc-7ea7-4a63-aaa4-02253aecdc97">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">is permitted by</data>
    </edge>
