      <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
      <data key="d4">PERSON</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="58227a0c-85bd-4ca0-9fe2-c849ab8cd359" target="733e007b-2032-4415-b036-8bc7d68d0310">
      <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
      <data key="d4">DATE</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="58227a0c-85bd-4ca0-9fe2-c849ab8cd359" target="6a8c51d1-93b9-4569-86fd-03b5a2ff4a43">
      <data key="d3">The second sentence states that SecureLife Insurance Company disclaims responsibility for assignment validity. This has no bearing on the age-related factors influencing conversion decisions discussed in the first sentence.</data>
      <data key="d4">NONE</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="58227a0c-85bd-4ca0-9fe2-c849ab8cd359" target="f99df0d3-695f-4ae7-a1f8-eaf509b3c369">
      <data key="d3">The second sentence states that SecureLife Insurance Company disclaims responsibility for assignment validity, whereas the first focuses on how the size of converted coverage influences results. No causal or sequential link exists between them.</data>
      <data key="d4">NONE</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="58227a0c-85bd-4ca0-9fe2-c849ab8cd359" target="cb928733-e199-4fdb-837b-0be5aae920be">
      <data key="d3">The insurer's non-responsibility for assignment validity is independent of how the policy class impacts conversion decisions.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="58227a0c-85bd-4ca0-9fe2-c849ab8cd359" target="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b">
      <data key="d3">The company's disclaimers regarding assignment validity pertain to legal standing and transfer of interest. This information does not influence or depend on the submission of a claim form, which is a distinct administrative task.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="58227a0c-85bd-4ca0-9fe2-c849ab8cd359" target="ecc65c44-a48a-4f2a-aa01-37fdd58978fd">
      <data key="d3">The statement about non-responsibility for assignment validity is unrelated to the need for submitting a death certificate during a claim.</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="58227a0c-85bd-4ca0-9fe2-c849ab8cd359" target="4f67aca9-2ed1-4582-9192-9aa38dccf3e4">
      <data key="d3">The company's disclaimer about assignment validity has no bearing on the requirement to provide the original policy when filing a death benefit claim.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="58227a0c-85bd-4ca0-9fe2-c849ab8cd359" target="93c2148f-1bce-4ce3-bc8c-ba54d157bd99">
      <data key="d3">The lack of responsibility for assignment validity by SecureLife Insurance Company does not affect the requirement to send claims to the same entity; these are independent administrative conditions.</data>
      <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="58227a0c-85bd-4ca0-9fe2-c849ab8cd359" target="e102366f-ab52-4878-8cf7-8763f33b2392">
      <data key="d3">The disclaimer about non-responsibility for assignment validity has no bearing on where claims should be submitted. This clause pertains to legal obligations related to transfers of policy rights, unrelated to filing procedures.</data>
      <data key="d4">NONE</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="58227a0c-85bd-4ca0-9fe2-c849ab8cd359" target="1f53ae68-2eb4-4755-b66c-aa693a6029cb">
      <data key="d3">The lack of liability for assignment validity does not affect how claims are submitted or where they should be sent. This statement stands separately from the claims mailing instructions.</data>
      <data key="d4">NONE</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="58227a0c-85bd-4ca0-9fe2-c849ab8cd359" target="48cefe40-498d-4ea8-8c59-1a68bc65d395">
      <data key="d3">The lack of liability for assignment validity stands independently; it does not rely on or affect the timing conditions set by the incontestability clause.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="58227a0c-85bd-4ca0-9fe2-c849ab8cd359" target="52ad74d3-5275-4b1c-9bcf-18120fb60997">
      <data key="d3">The second sentence states that SecureLife does not guarantee the legal validity of assigned policies. This stands independently from the mechanism used to recalibrate benefits based on accurate age information.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="58227a0c-85bd-4ca0-9fe2-c849ab8cd359" target="ef3425a0-1e50-49ab-b5a8-ef77f6ab44bc">
      <data key="d3">The second sentence states that SecureLife is not liable for whether a policy assignment is legally valid. This stands independently from the first sentence, which concerns actuarial corrections to death benefits based on gender misstatement.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="58227a0c-85bd-4ca0-9fe2-c849ab8cd359" target="7d8ac6d1-e47e-4ba7-b0a0-e181d124cf19">
      <data key="d3">The second sentence clarifies that the company disclaims liability for the legitimacy of policy assignments, whereas the first describes a mechanism for correcting death benefits when age was misrepresented. These topics address separate administrative and financial safeguards without influencing one another.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="58227a0c-85bd-4ca0-9fe2-c849ab8cd359" target="6946e734-a717-40f6-a7c6-8217055992b2">
      <data key="d3">The second sentence states that SecureLife is not liable for assignment validity, which has no bearing on how misstatements about sex impact death benefits as described in the first sentence.</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="58227a0c-85bd-4ca0-9fe2-c849ab8cd359" target="9bd83bcc-7ea7-4a63-aaa4-02253aecdc97">
      <data key="d3">Since the insurer disclaims responsibility for assignment validity, it limits the enforceability or protection associated with the policyholder’s action of assignment.</data>
      <data key="d4">LIMITS</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="58227a0c-85bd-4ca0-9fe2-c849ab8cd359" target="173ed3d5-0eb1-4ff3-a7bb-5ccb01ff26f9">
      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 establishes that SecureLife does not guarantee the validity of assignments, setting the stage for why explicit confirmation via written notice is required. Fact_sentence_2 clarifies that actual legal effect occurs only upon official receipt of such notice.</data>
      <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="58227a0c-85bd-4ca0-9fe2-c849ab8cd359" target="1dc42f01-adb8-4c75-b203-736d121f74ba">
      <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 discusses the insurer's lack of responsibility for assignment validity, which is independent of when the document was issued.</data>
      <data key="d4">NONE</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="58227a0c-85bd-4ca0-9fe2-c849ab8cd359" target="89eb9f0b-fb9d-4ed0-96df-faae58d5ebda">
      <data key="d3">The statement about SecureLife's non-responsibility for assignment validity does not influence nor relate to who is authorized to sign the document.</data>
      <data key="d4">NONE</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="58227a0c-85bd-4ca0-9fe2-c849ab8cd359" target="f60bbb6f-361a-478e-b45e-8d28c60a0370">
      <data key="d3">While the company disclaims liability for assignment validity, it still commits to timely claim payouts upon receipt of proper documents, regardless of assignment status.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
