    <edge source="173ed3d5-0eb1-4ff3-a7bb-5ccb01ff26f9" target="6a8c51d1-93b9-4569-86fd-03b5a2ff4a43">
      <data key="d3">The second sentence specifies that a policy assignment only binds the insurer after receiving written notification, while the first focuses on age-based eligibility rules for policy conversion.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
