    <edge source="173ed3d5-0eb1-4ff3-a7bb-5ccb01ff26f9" target="f99df0d3-695f-4ae7-a1f8-eaf509b3c369">
      <data key="d3">Whether an assignment binds the insurer depends solely on receiving written notice; it has no bearing on the amount of coverage being converted under the policy.</data>
      <data key="d4">NO RELATIONSHIP</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="173ed3d5-0eb1-4ff3-a7bb-5ccb01ff26f9" target="cb928733-e199-4fdb-837b-0be5aae920be">
      <data key="d3">SecureLife Insurance Company will not recognize any policy assignment unless notified in writing at its home office, regardless of the policy's classification or conversion features.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="173ed3d5-0eb1-4ff3-a7bb-5ccb01ff26f9" target="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b">
      <data key="d3">The effectiveness of a policy assignment depends solely on written notification to SecureLife’s home office and does not require or influence the submission of a claim form by the beneficiary.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="173ed3d5-0eb1-4ff3-a7bb-5ccb01ff26f9" target="ecc65c44-a48a-4f2a-aa01-37fdd58978fd">
      <data key="d3">A policy assignment only binds the company after receiving written notice, independent of the claims procedures such as submitting a death certificate.</data>
      <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="173ed3d5-0eb1-4ff3-a7bb-5ccb01ff26f9" target="93c2148f-1bce-4ce3-bc8c-ba54d157bd99">
      <data key="d3">SecureLife does not recognize policy assignments without written notice at its home office, reinforcing the need for documented communication. Similarly, claims must also be submitted directly to SecureLife, underscoring consistent procedural expectations for interaction with the insurer.</data>
      <data key="d4">REINFORCES</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="173ed3d5-0eb1-4ff3-a7bb-5ccb01ff26f9" target="e102366f-ab52-4878-8cf7-8763f33b2392">
      <data key="d3">Receiving written notice about a policy assignment at the home office has no bearing on where claims must be submitted. Both rules apply independently to different transaction types.</data>
      <data key="d4">NONE</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="173ed3d5-0eb1-4ff3-a7bb-5ccb01ff26f9" target="1f53ae68-2eb4-4755-b66c-aa693a6029cb">
      <data key="d3">A policy assignment only becomes effective upon receiving written notice at the home office; however, this condition has no bearing on where claims must be mailed.</data>
      <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="173ed3d5-0eb1-4ff3-a7bb-5ccb01ff26f9" target="f60bbb6f-361a-478e-b45e-8d28c60a0370">
      <data key="d3">The second statement specifies the requirement for written notice before an assignment binds the insurer. This does not affect how quickly claims are processed once submitted.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="173ed3d5-0eb1-4ff3-a7bb-5ccb01ff26f9" target="4f67aca9-2ed1-4582-9192-9aa38dccf3e4">
      <data key="d3">A policy assignment requires formal notification to SecureLife before being enforceable, whereas submitting the original policy is necessary for initiating a death benefit claim. Both actions concern the policy’s physical status but serve distinct legal purposes.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.15</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="173ed3d5-0eb1-4ff3-a7bb-5ccb01ff26f9" target="48cefe40-498d-4ea8-8c59-1a68bc65d395">
      <data key="d3">A policy assignment requires written notification to the insurer before becoming effective, regardless of whether the policy is subject to an incontestability clause.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="173ed3d5-0eb1-4ff3-a7bb-5ccb01ff26f9" target="52ad74d3-5275-4b1c-9bcf-18120fb60997">
      <data key="d3">The second sentence specifies that a policy assignment only becomes effective after SecureLife receives written notice. This condition is independent of whether the death benefit was adjusted due to incorrect age reporting.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="173ed3d5-0eb1-4ff3-a7bb-5ccb01ff26f9" target="ef3425a0-1e50-49ab-b5a8-ef77f6ab44bc">
      <data key="d3">The second sentence states that a policy assignment only becomes legally binding after SecureLife receives written notification. This condition is independent of whether the death benefit was adjusted due to a misstated sex.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="173ed3d5-0eb1-4ff3-a7bb-5ccb01ff26f9" target="7d8ac6d1-e47e-4ba7-b0a0-e181d124cf19">
      <data key="d3">The second sentence specifies that any assignment of the policy requires formal notification to SecureLife Insurance Company before it becomes effective. This condition stands independent of whether the death benefit has been adjusted due to prior misstatements.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="173ed3d5-0eb1-4ff3-a7bb-5ccb01ff26f9" target="6946e734-a717-40f6-a7c6-8217055992b2">
      <data key="d3">The second sentence describes the condition under which a policy assignment takes effect—requiring written notice to the insurer. This has no bearing on how misstatements regarding sex impact benefit amounts.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="173ed3d5-0eb1-4ff3-a7bb-5ccb01ff26f9" target="58227a0c-85bd-4ca0-9fe2-c849ab8cd359">
      <data key="d3">The necessity for written notice arises because SecureLife disclaims responsibility for assignment validity, meaning it cannot act on an assignment without direct confirmation from the assignor.</data>
      <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="173ed3d5-0eb1-4ff3-a7bb-5ccb01ff26f9" target="89eb9f0b-fb9d-4ed0-96df-faae58d5ebda">
      <data key="d3">The requirement for written notice to SecureLife Insurance Company regarding policy assignments relies on proper authentication, which may involve authorized signatures such as those from senior officers like the Chief Underwriting Officer.</data>
      <data key="d4">SUPPORTS</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="173ed3d5-0eb1-4ff3-a7bb-5ccb01ff26f9" target="9bd83bcc-7ea7-4a63-aaa4-02253aecdc97">
      <data key="d3">SecureLife’s acceptance of written notice is required before any policy assignment becomes binding, meaning the initial assignment action cannot have legal force without it.</data>
      <data key="d4">CONDITIONS</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="173ed3d5-0eb1-4ff3-a7bb-5ccb01ff26f9" target="1dc42f01-adb8-4c75-b203-736d121f74ba">
      <data key="d3">The validity of a policy assignment depends on receiving written notice from the insurer's home office; however, this condition is independent of when the document was originally issued.</data>
      <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
