      <data key="d3">The Chief Underwriting Officer’s authorization confirms official approval of the document, yet this does not influence how attained age impacts conversion decisions, which depend solely on policy rules.</data>
      <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.0</data>
